  "content": "<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h3>新增物品</h3>\n<p><strong>下界合金鞘翅</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在岩浆或火焰中不会燃烧</li>\n<li>提供 +4 点护甲值</li>\n<li>双倍耐久度（864）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>新合成配方</h3>\n<p><strong>下界合金鞘翅锻造配方</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下界合金升级锻造模板</li>\n<li>鞘翅</li>\n<li>下界合金锭</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>新进度</h3>\n<p><strong>重金属之翼</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>获得下界合金鞘翅</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鞘翅装饰 (Elytra Trims)</a>，作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKikuGie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KikuGie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鞘翅物理 (Elytra Physics)</a>，作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fOhHeyItsJosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OhHeyItsJosh</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>常见问题</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>问：你会支持其他 Minecraft 版本和模组加载器吗？</strong></p>\n  <p>答：如果我的 Discord 社区中有足够多的需求，我会将该模组移植到其他版本和模组加载器。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fpw8BsjsXfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>",
